        <mxCell id="c_acccbf3aa9" value="&lt;div style=&#39;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-bottom:8px&#39;&gt;PRODUCTION QUESTION&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.28;color:#1F2937;text-align:left&#39;&gt;“What happens when arrival rate &amp;gt; service rate?”&lt;br&gt;Queue grows, latency grows, then saturation/rejection occurs unless backpressure is designed.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;spacing=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
